              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "e"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was barely okay. It stuck to the pan, and was kind of bland. It did taste very broccoli-ish, so it fills the veggie requirements, and it did not have too much oil in it, so it was healthier than most cornbreads. I do not think I will make it again, though.",
